        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 131,
            "end": 146,
            "text": "HEB for eyes; i.e., as a guide."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 10:31",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 10,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "And it shall be, if thou go with us, yea, it shall be, that what goodness the Lord shall do unto us, the same will we do unto thee.",
